# Cybersecurity Portfolio

Welcome! This repository documents my hands-on experience in cybersecurity, featuring projects from the **Google Cybersecurity Professional Certificate** and independent security research.

## 🛠️ Technical Skills
* **Languages:** Python, SQL, Bash
* **OS:** Linux (Ubuntu), Windows, Kali Linux
* **Tools:** Wireshark, tcpdump, Nmap, Splunk, Chronicle (SIEM)
* **Frameworks:** NIST CSF, MITRE ATT&CK

## 📁 Featured Projects
* [Network Traffic Analysis](./Network-Security) - Investigating ICMP and DNS traffic using Wireshark.
* [Python Security Automation](./Python-Scripts) - Automating file access updates and log parsing.
* [SQL Data Auditing](./SQL-Queries) - Querying employee and machine databases for security compliance.

